      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Many patients complaining of acute pain in the lumbosacral area suffer from affections of intrapelvic organs (urinary bladder, prostate glands, female genital-organs). The routine diagnosis in such cases is described. In 53 own patients the analgesic and anti-inflammatory effect of Dolo-Neurobion has been evaluated. It is a combination drug consisting of the neurotropic vitamins B1, B6 and B12 and the analgesic metamizole. The treatment was started parenterally in the recommended doses and continued orally. If there were definite signs of infection in the pelvic area, additional antibiotics were administered after bacteriological tests. Dolo-Neurobion showed good or excellent results in 77,4% and moderate effects in 15,1% of the patients. There were no major side-effects or intolerance."},
